anv: H.264 HuC BRC with the Xe2_HPM update tables

media-driver replaces the Gen12 AVC BRC update tables for Xe2_HPM (EncodeAvcVdencConstSettingsXe2_Hpm::SetBrcSettings):
global rate ratio thresholds {40,75,97,103,125,160} / QP {-3..3}, GlobalRateQPAdj I/P/B, DistThreshld I/P and a
separate B table (ANV gave B the P thresholds), and one DistQPAdj table for CBR and VBR. Use them on Xe2.

--- a/src/intel/vulkan/genX_huc_brc.h
+++ b/src/intel/vulkan/genX_huc_brc.h
@@ -305,6 +305,45 @@
